    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Serenity Jewel | Coastal Retreat Steps from 30A Beach<br><br>Serenity Jewel is a 6-bedroom coastal retreat designed for multi-generational families, groups, and guests seeking a resort-style escape on 30A. Thoughtfully designed with comfort, style, and wellness in mind, this home offers expansive living spaces and one-of-a-kind amenities.<br><br>The home features multiple spacious bedrooms with en suite or nearby bathrooms, several distinct living areas, and a kitchen ideal for gathering, entertaining, and making memories together. The open-concept main living space flows seamlessly to the outdoors, creating an effortless indoor–outdoor coastal lifestyle.<br><br>Separate dining areas allow flexibility for adults, kids, and teens, while additional living spaces throughout the home provide room for everyone to spread out and relax. An upstairs lounge and game-friendly area make this home especially appealing for families traveling with children and teens.<br><br>Location – East End of 30A<br><br>Serenity Jewel is ideally located on the coveted east end of Scenic Highway 30A, just 1-2 miles from Rosemary Beach, Alys Beach, Seacrest, The HUB, Kaia, & Watersound. Enjoy world-class dining, boutique shopping, bike paths, and vibrant community spaces—all easily accessible by bike, golf cart, or short drive.<br><br>***Awesome Beach Access*** – Steps from 30A Beach<br><br>The home is located just 75 steps and just a couple minute walk from a private, deeded beach access. This access is one of the only accesses in the area where you don't have to worry about homeowners owning the sand. It boasts nearly a mile of non-private sand. This access is spacious, uncrowded, and unaffected by nearby beach restrictions—offering a relaxed, enjoyable beach experience for your entire group. This is rare for the area.<br><br>Private Outdoor Oasis<br><br>The outdoor space at Serenity Jewel is designed to feel like your own private coastal resort.<br><br>After hanging out at the beach all day, step directly into a full-sized (rare for this area) heated pool, surrounded by comfortable lounge seating and tropical landscaping. Whether you’re enjoying morning coffee poolside or unwinding after a beach day, this space is made for relaxation.<br><br>The privacy and amenities in the backyard is another rarity for the area. Have your little ones enjoying a playground on top of artificial turf while you sit and drink wine around the fire pit. Enjoy a private hot tub session while looking up at the stars. Or grill out and bake pizzas while enjoying cornhole before eating at the oversized outdoor table.<br><br>The amount of privacy that you will be able to enjoy at this house is really what sets it apart from others in 30a. Enjoy your family time and all the amenities Serenity Jewel has to offer while not being looked at by 6 other houses that are packed in like sardines in a small area.<br><br>Pool heating available for $50/day.<br><br>A rare highlight:<br><br>Private Barrel Sauna — a true wellness experience. Enjoy spa-like sauna sessions in complete privacy, perfect for relaxation, recovery, and elevated vacation living.<br><br>Additional outdoor features include:<br><br>Fire pit for evening gatherings<br><br>Playground area with artificial turf so your little ones stay clean<br><br>Outdoor dining and grilling area (includes a separate grill & pizza oven)<br><br>Comfortable shaded seating<br><br>Space for kids to play and families to gather<br><br>Designed for Every Age<br><br>Families with Babies & Young Children:<br><br>Kid-friendly layout with separation from main gathering spaces<br><br>Bikes for every age provided<br><br><br>Teens:<br><br>Dedicated hangout spaces for games/arcade, TV, and downtime<br>Space for bringing your own gaming system<br><br>Bikes for juniors and teens to explore the nearby villages of 30a<br><br>Pool, hot tub, fire pit, bikes, and beach access keep teens entertained all day<br><br>Walkable proximity to the beach provides peace of mind<br><br>Adults:<br><br>Comfortable bedrooms<br><br>Multiple quiet spaces for reading, napping, or working remotely<br><br>Spa-inspired amenities including the private barrel sauna<br><br>Seamless indoor–outdoor entertaining<br><br>Senior Guests:<br><br>Easy access throughout the main living areas<br><br>King Sized bed and en suite bath on ground level<br><br>Minimal steps to common spaces<br><br>Multiple outdoor seating options<br><br>Comfort & Convenience:<br><br>Fully stocked kitchen with cookware, dishes, and coffee setup<br><br>High-speed WiFi throughout the home<br><br>Beach essentials provided (chairs, wagon, umbrella)<br><br>Bikes provided (5 of varying sizes)<br><br>Convenient access to Highway 98 (1 mile away) for easy trips to Destin or Panama City Beach<br><br>Close proximity to Publix, dining, and shopping<br><br>A True 30A Luxury Experience<br><br>From sunrise beach walks to sunset sauna sessions, Serenity Jewel offers a refined yet relaxed coastal experience designed to help you slow down, reconnect, and create unforgettable memories.<br><br>We look forward to welcoming you and helping you enjoy everything 30A has to offer.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
